# MPED Accepted Baseline (locked)

Treat the current UI as the **accepted reference**. Do not change shell, tokens, chart selector chrome, or matrix header colors unless the user asks.

## Stack
React 19 + Vite + Tailwind 4 + Recharts 3 + lucide-react + Cairo (RTL). Mock data in `src/data/mock.js`.

## Tokens (`src/index.css`)
navy `#1f254b` · navy-deep `#052c65` · primary `#1b75ff` · primary-2 `#0986ed` · page `#f5f6fa` · ink `#404040` · muted `#7f8999` · success/danger/warning/purple as themed. Outer chrome `#1b1d22`. Borders often `#D8D8D8`.

## Shell (`Layout.jsx`)
- RTL `dir="rtl"`; frame `min-w-[1100px]` `max-w-[1920px]` `bg-page`
- Sidebar expanded **329px** / collapsed **121px**; active pill `bg-primary`
- Topbar **74px**; page padding typically `p-8` (detail: `px-8 pt-7`)

## Dashboard charts (`Dashboard.jsx`)
- Card: **345×** flex, radius **20**, selector frame **217×39**, icons **26** hit / **19** draw
- Types LTR: pie → donut(LifeBuoy) → line → column(bar) → hbar — **must switch chart type**
- Active icon: bg `rgba(9,134,237,0.09)` `#0986ED`; inactive `#052C65`
- Status colors: اعتماد `#1B75FF` · تعديل `#FF8C08` · متأخرة `#DC2626` · معتمدة `#16A34A`
- Charts use `dir="ltr"`; pie/donut tooltip shows **name : value** (e.g. `قيد الاعتماد : 40 %`)
- Chart rows: `max-w-[1535.5px]`, gap **63px**, `flex-row-reverse`

## Request detail
- In-page breadcrumb (Cairo): parent `#ADB5BD` → navigate-next rotated → «تفاصيل الطلب» `#052C65`
- Info tile icon box **60×60** radius 15 bg `#2563EB4D`
- Tabs Cairo; active underline `#0986ED` / text `#052C65`
- Matrix headers, row labels, totals: **`#DDEBF4`**; form tables **match statement type**; **نموذج البيان = empty (`-`)**, **استيفاء البيانات = filled numbers**
- Notes: seed + add/list/delete + `localStorage` `mped-notes-${id}`; تعديل requests include modification-request note
- Actions: hide both buttons if `تعديل`; hide approve only if `معتمدة`; otherwise show both

## Auth (mock)
- Flow `/login` → `/verify` → `/loading` (3s) → protected app; state in `src/context/AuthContext.jsx`, `localStorage` key `mped-auth` = `{ email, name, role, allowed, code, stage: otp|loading|ready }`
- Login email field opens a `demoUsers` picker (mock.js) that auto-fills email + password; **only مشرف الإدارة العامة (`enabled: true`) reaches the dashboard** — the rest show «قيد التطوير» after verification
- Verification code is random per sign-in and types itself digit by digit every 450ms into read-only boxes; confirm/resend disabled while typing; resend countdown 60s; guards in `RequireAuth.jsx` (`STAGE_ROUTE = { otp: "/verify", loading: "/loading" }`)
- `AuthShell.jsx`: frame `min-w-[1100px]`/`max-w-[1920px]` on `#1b1d22`, page bg `#F6F7F8`, `/dots.png` top-right + rotated bottom-left at 34.72% of frame width, opacity 0.6; card **660.8×561.6** radius `26.67px` bg `#E9ECEF` shadow `0 5.33px 5.33px #00000040`, `gap-[35px]`, content column 478.94; logo `/auth-logo.png`
- Inputs 52px white border `#D8D8D8`, icon on the **left**, placeholder `#ADB5BD`; primary buttons height `65.61px` radius `11.72px` bg `#0747A5`; OTP four 58×58 boxes `dir="ltr"`
- `roles` in `mock.js` keeps the 6 role definitions for future flows; signed-in name + role show in the topbar; sidebar تسجيل الخروج calls `signOut()` → `/login`

## Rules of engagement
- Prefer extending existing patterns over new visual systems
- Keep Arabic copy; RTL layout; LTR only for charts/email/phone where already done
- No drive-by refactors of accepted screens while building new pages
